Jev 1.13 is a typed decision engine (TypeSafe AI System One), not a text-generating LLM. It returns noul/choice/score with calibrated probabilities in ~0.6 s — it cannot produce free-form text, so Tool use, Reasoning, Coding, and Multimodal axes are not applicable in the standard LLM sense. JevBench 1.5.4 score 72.13 is a proprietary decision-accuracy benchmark, not comparable to LLM benchmarks. No MMLU, HumanEval, MATH, LiveCodeBench or equivalent general-purpose LLM scores are published. Self-exclusion: scoring this entry on the five standard axes would produce a misleading result.

Provided by: **Claude Sonnet 4.6 (anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6-20260205)** — 2026-10-21
